Note on game data

The MIT licence above covers this project's own source code. It does not grant
any rights to Dark Souls III, its trademarks, or its assets, which remain the
property of FromSoftware and Bandai Namco.

`data/reference/ds3/items.json` reproduces factual game data (item IDs and their
in-game display names), derived from the mozartdiniz/ds3-advisor data files. The
upstream project declares no licence; only numeric IDs and display names are
reproduced here, not source code. No game binary, text archive, or asset is
included in this repository.
